  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| webdriverio | devDependencies | minor | [`5.6.4` -> `5.7.1`](https://diff.intrinsic.com/webdriverio/5.6.4/5.7.1) | [homepage](https://webdriver.io), [source](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>webdriverio/webdriverio</summary>\n\n### [`v5.7.1`](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;571-2019-03-07)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/compare/v5.7.0...v5.7.1)\n\n##### :eyeglasses: Spec Compliancy\n\n-   `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3680](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3680) webdriverio: fix control key w3c compliancy ([@&#8203;LukoyanovE](https://togithub.com/LukoyanovE))\n    -   [#&#8203;3601](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3601) webdriverio: isDisplayed() change for browsers without the endpoint ([@&#8203;abjerstedt](https://togithub.com/abjerstedt))\n-   `webdriver`\n    -   [#&#8203;3678](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3678) Fixed typo signalStrength ([@&#8203;khanhdodang](https://togithub.com/khanhdodang))\n\n##### :bug: Bug Fix\n\n-   `wdio-firefox-profile-service`\n    -   [#&#8203;3692](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3692) wdio-firefox-profile: legacy handling ([@&#8203;abjerstedt](https://togithub.com/abjerstedt))\n-   `webdriver`\n    -   [#&#8203;3690](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3690) webdriver: Fix error matcher for edge 15-17 ([@&#8203;abjerstedt](https://togithub.com/abjerstedt))\n-   `wdio-webdriver-mock-service`, `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3681](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3681) webdriverio: middleware refactor ([@&#8203;abjerstedt](https://togithub.com/abjerstedt))\n\n##### :memo: Documentation\n\n-   `wdio-sync`, `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3688](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3688) update to absolute references to webdriver-io-core ([@&#8203;FelixZilber](https://togithub.com/FelixZilber))\n\n##### Committers: 4\n\n-   Adam Bjerstedt ([@&#8203;abjerstedt](https://togithub.com/abjerstedt))\n-   Evgeniy Lukoyanov ([@&#8203;LukoyanovE](https://togithub.com/LukoyanovE))\n-   FeL ([@&#8203;FelixZilber](https://togithub.com/FelixZilber))\n-   Khanh Do ([@&#8203;khanhdodang](https://togithub.com/khanhdodang))\n\n### [`v5.7.0`](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;570-2019-03-05)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/compare/v5.6.6...v5.7.0)\n\n##### :rocket: New Feature\n\n-   `wdio-cli`, `wdio-local-runner`, `wdio-reporter`, `wdio-runner`\n    -   [#&#8203;3381](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3381) Retries per specfile ([@&#8203;bennieswart](https://togithub.com/bennieswart))\n-   `webdriver`, `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3677](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3677) Appium saveRecordingScreen ([@&#8203;mgrybyk](https://togithub.com/mgrybyk))\n\n##### :bug: Bug Fix\n\n-   `wdio-runner`, `wdio-smoke-test-reporter`, `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3679](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3679) Add smoke test for custom reporters ([@&#8203;christian-bromann](https://togithub.com/christian-bromann))\n-   `wdio-logger`\n    -   [#&#8203;3675](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3675) wdio-logger: fix webdriver log colors ([@&#8203;mgrybyk](https://togithub.com/mgrybyk))\n-   `wdio-webdriver-mock-service`, `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3662](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3662) Fixing Refetch to handle slow rerenders ([@&#8203;abjerstedt](https://togithub.com/abjerstedt))\n\n##### :nail_care: Polish\n\n-   `wdio-allure-reporter`\n    -   [#&#8203;3676](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3676) wdio-allure-reporter: start end step ([@&#8203;mgrybyk](https://togithub.com/mgrybyk))\n-   `wdio-reporter`\n    -   [#&#8203;3672](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3672) Issue 3416: pass multiple errors through to test stats for reporting if available ([@&#8203;nicholasbailey](https://togithub.com/nicholasbailey))\n-   `wdio-mocha-framework`, `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3674](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3674) mochaOpts.require after wrapping functions with Fibers ([@&#8203;mgrybyk](https://togithub.com/mgrybyk))\n\n##### :house: Internal\n\n-   [#&#8203;3647](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3647) Update governance model ([@&#8203;christian-bromann](https://togithub.com/christian-bromann))\n\n##### Committers: 5\n\n-   Adam Bjerstedt ([@&#8203;abjerstedt](https://togithub.com/abjerstedt))\n-   Bennie Swart ([@&#8203;bennieswart](https://togithub.com/bennieswart))\n-   Christian Bromann ([@&#8203;christian-bromann](https://togithub.com/christian-bromann))\n-   Mykola Grybyk ([@&#8203;mgrybyk](https://togithub.com/mgrybyk))\n-   Nicholas Bailey ([@&#8203;nicholasbailey](https://togithub.com/nicholasbailey))\n\n### [`v5.6.6`](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;566-2019-03-04)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/compare/v5.6.5...v5.6.6)\n\n##### :bug: Bug Fix\n\n-   `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3664](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3664) Fix for [#&#8203;3663](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/issues/3663): utils.js/getElementRect fallback ([@&#8203;flunderpero](https://togithub.com/flunderpero))\n\n##### Committers: 1\n\n-   [@&#8203;flunderpero](https://togithub.com/flunderpero)\n\n### [`v5.6.5`](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;565-2019-03-04)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/compare/v5.6.4...v5.6.5)\n\n##### :rocket: New Feature\n\n-   `webdriver`\n    -   [#&#8203;3661](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3661) webdriver: Add strictSSL option ([@&#8203;martinfrancois](https://togithub.com/martinfrancois))\n\n##### :nail_care: Polish\n\n-   `wdio-jasmine-framework`\n    -   [#&#8203;3669](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3669) Issue 3416: pass all failed expectations through from wdio-jasmine-framework ([@&#8203;nicholasbailey](https://togithub.com/nicholasbailey))\n\n##### :memo: Documentation\n\n-   `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3660](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3660) Fix optional tagging ([@&#8203;christian-bromann](https://togithub.com/christian-bromann))\n-   Other\n    -   [#&#8203;3659](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3659) Add type mobileEmulationEnabled ([@&#8203;tadashi0713](https://togithub.com/tadashi0713))\n    -   [#&#8203;3657](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3657) Some grammatical and spelling fixes ([@&#8203;Marketionist](https://togithub.com/Marketionist))\n    -   [#&#8203;3653](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3653) docs: Update 'watch' example in CONTRIBUTING.md ([@&#8203;klamping](https://togithub.com/klamping))\n\n##### Committers: 6\n\n-   Christian Bromann ([@&#8203;christian-bromann](https://togithub.com/christian-bromann))\n-   Dmytro Shpakovskyi ([@&#8203;Marketionist](https://togithub.com/Marketionist))\n-   François Martin ([@&#8203;martinfrancois](https://togithub.com/martinfrancois))\n-   Kevin Lamping ([@&#8203;klamping](https://togithub.com/klamping))\n-   Nicholas Bailey ([@&#8203;nicholasbailey](https://togithub.com/nicholasbailey))\n-   Tadashi Nemoto ([@&#8203;tadashi0713](https://togithub.com/tadashi0713))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
